1
00:00:01,084 --> 00:00:03,294
<i>Hello? Who is this?!</i>

2
00:00:03,378 --> 00:00:07,716
[MODULATED VOICE]
<i>June 18, 2013, at around 8:00 p.m.</i>

3
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:11,052
<i>It was raining heavily</i>
<i>and the road was dark.</i>

4
00:00:11,136 --> 00:00:13,263
<i>You ran over a woman,</i>

5
00:00:13,346 --> 00:00:15,140
<i>and you didn't help her.</i>

6
00:00:16,099 --> 00:00:18,518
<i>You killed Jade Valentin.</i>

7
00:00:18,601 --> 00:00:20,895
<i>If you don't want me</i>
<i>to expose your secret,</i>

8
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,230
<i>call me.</i>

9
00:00:22,313 --> 00:00:23,815
<i>Let's talk.</i>

10
00:00:24,774 --> 00:00:25,692
<i>Bea?</i>

11
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:29,821
<i>I want to apologize on Billy's behalf.</i>

12
00:00:31,114 --> 00:00:32,991
<i>Try to understand her, guys.</i>

13
00:00:33,742 --> 00:00:36,202
<i>But, Jordan, this is too much.</i>

14
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:39,205
<i>It's not like we're just slacking off.</i>

15
00:00:39,289 --> 00:00:40,832
<i>I understand you, guys.</i>

16
00:00:41,833 --> 00:00:43,126
<i>But right now,</i>

17
00:00:44,002 --> 00:00:46,129
<i>Billy needs us the most.</i>

18
00:00:48,173 --> 00:00:50,550
<i>We've all enjoyed being by her side</i>

19
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:51,843
<i>when she's at her highest.</i>

20
00:00:52,802 --> 00:00:54,929
<i>Let's not abandon her</i>
<i>when she's at her lowest.</i>

21
00:00:55,638 --> 00:00:59,142
[MODULATED VOICE] <i>If you don't want</i>
<i>the whole world and your best friend</i>

22
00:00:59,225 --> 00:01:02,437
<i>to know that you're the one</i>
<i>who killed his mom,</i>

23
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,647
<i>you're going to give me</i>
<i>three million pesos.</i>

24
00:01:12,697 --> 00:01:13,531
<i>Bea!</i>

25
00:01:14,282 --> 00:01:15,492
<i>What's so funny?!</i>

26
00:01:16,076 --> 00:01:17,160
<i>Are you happy now?!</i>

27
00:01:17,994 --> 00:01:19,037
<i>You're happy?</i>

28
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:21,081
<i>You're really making sure</i>
<i>I lose everything, aren't you?!</i>

29
00:01:21,164 --> 00:01:22,999
<i>First, Dad.</i>

30
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:26,753
<i>Then Auntie Pres. Then Oliver.</i>

31
00:01:26,836 --> 00:01:28,421
<i>Now Jordan?</i>

32
00:01:28,505 --> 00:01:31,633
<i>Is that why you've resorted to blackmail?!</i>

33
00:01:31,716 --> 00:01:33,176
<i>Are you okay?</i>

34
00:01:33,259 --> 00:01:34,803
<i>What's going on?</i>

35
00:01:34,886 --> 00:01:36,095
<i>What's going on?!</i>

36
00:01:38,181 --> 00:01:41,351
<i>You happened, Bea!</i>
<i>You happened!</i>

37
00:01:45,605 --> 00:01:46,815
[BEA] <i>Pa, please believe me.</i>

38
00:01:46,898 --> 00:01:49,609
<i>I'm really telling the truth this time.</i>

39
00:01:49,692 --> 00:01:51,444
<i>I had nothing to do with it.</i>

40
00:01:51,528 --> 00:01:53,613
<i>I know you're telling the truth.</i>

41
00:01:53,696 --> 00:01:57,867
<i>But I hope you can understand</i>
<i>why Billy is suspicious of you.</i>

42
00:01:59,244 --> 00:02:00,662
[BEA] <i>Of course.</i>

43
00:02:00,745 --> 00:02:03,414
<i>I know where Billy's coming from.</i>

44
00:02:05,625 --> 00:02:06,960
[KNOCKING]

45
00:02:13,424 --> 00:02:14,968
<i>Billy. What are you doing here?</i>

46
00:02:15,552 --> 00:02:19,889
<i>Tell your accomplice that</i>
<i>I will never give you any money.</i>

47
00:02:19,973 --> 00:02:23,560
<i>Billy, I'm trying to change!</i>

48
00:02:23,643 --> 00:02:27,856
<i>I want to make up for all the things</i>
<i>my mother and I did to you.</i>

49
00:02:30,066 --> 00:02:34,487
<i>It's hard to trust someone</i>
<i>who's lied to you over and over.</i>

50
00:02:38,825 --> 00:02:41,327
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

51
00:02:41,911 --> 00:02:44,622
Have you traced the number I gave you?

52
00:02:44,706 --> 00:02:46,708
[OFFICER] <i>Ma'am, it's not that easy.</i>

53
00:02:46,791 --> 00:02:49,002
So what? There's nothing
you can do about it again?

54
00:02:49,085 --> 00:02:51,838
[OFFICER] <i>We're doing</i>
<i>everything we can, ma'am.</i>

55
00:02:51,921 --> 00:02:58,803
[BROODING MUSIC PLAYING]

56
00:03:02,390 --> 00:03:03,933
[CHARM] Oh… Chief!

57
00:03:04,017 --> 00:03:05,560
I sent you an email

58
00:03:05,643 --> 00:03:09,689
with the revised proposal
for our potential advertisers.

59
00:03:09,772 --> 00:03:11,608
It's still waiting for your approval.

60
00:03:11,691 --> 00:03:13,151
Have you had a chance to look at it?

61
00:03:13,234 --> 00:03:15,486
Can it wait, Charm?!

62
00:03:17,071 --> 00:03:18,990
Oh. Okay.

63
00:03:19,073 --> 00:03:25,955
[BROODING MUSIC CONTINUES]

64
00:03:29,584 --> 00:03:31,586
[PHONE CHIMES]

65
00:03:35,757 --> 00:03:37,634
[MODULATED VOICE]
<i>It's time for the whole world to know</i>

66
00:03:37,717 --> 00:03:41,095
<i>that LoveList CEO Billy Cariño</i>
<i>is a criminal.</i>

67
00:03:41,179 --> 00:03:43,223
<i>June 18, 2013,</i>

68
00:03:43,306 --> 00:03:45,141
<i>at 8:30 p.m.,</i>

69
00:03:45,225 --> 00:03:48,144
<i>on Feliciano Street, Barangay Del Mundo.</i>

70
00:03:48,228 --> 00:03:51,981
<i>She killed Jade Valentin in a hit-and-run.</i>

71
00:03:52,065 --> 00:03:54,984
<i>She was the mother</i>
<i>of Billy's friend, Jordan Valentin.</i>

72
00:03:55,068 --> 00:03:56,402
<i>I saw it with my own eyes.</i>

73
00:03:56,486 --> 00:03:58,238
<i>You were the one</i>
<i>who killed her, Billy Cariño!</i>

74
00:03:58,321 --> 00:04:00,782
<i>You're a murderer! You're a criminal!</i>

75
00:04:00,865 --> 00:04:02,367
<i>You have to face justice!</i>

76
00:04:02,450 --> 00:04:04,994
<i>You have to pay for what you've done!</i>

77
00:04:05,078 --> 00:04:09,290
[GRIM MUSIC PLAYING]

78
00:04:09,374 --> 00:04:10,750
[PHONE RINGING]

79
00:04:12,669 --> 00:04:14,879
I will give you another chance.

80
00:04:14,963 --> 00:04:16,965
If you don't follow through,

81
00:04:17,048 --> 00:04:19,342
this video will go viral,

82
00:04:19,425 --> 00:04:21,970
and you'll end up losing more.

83
00:04:22,553 --> 00:04:24,597
I have no money to give you.

84
00:04:25,598 --> 00:04:28,434
And even if I did,
I wouldn't give it to you.

85
00:04:28,518 --> 00:04:30,812
<i>What's your proof that I killed her, huh?</i>

86
00:04:31,813 --> 00:04:33,982
Do you really think I'll believe you?

87
00:04:34,065 --> 00:04:36,526
A lot of people will believe it
because it's true.

88
00:04:37,610 --> 00:04:39,279
I know your company is suffering losses.

89
00:04:39,362 --> 00:04:41,281
We all know that.

90
00:04:41,364 --> 00:04:43,741
It's all over social media,

91
00:04:43,825 --> 00:04:46,369
so if I post this video,

92
00:04:46,452 --> 00:04:48,162
your reputation will suffer more.

93
00:04:48,246 --> 00:04:51,457
You know that my company
is suffering losses?

94
00:04:51,541 --> 00:04:53,084
Who are you?!

95
00:04:54,919 --> 00:04:56,921
You're working with Bea, aren't you?

96
00:04:57,005 --> 00:04:58,089
Who's Bea?

97
00:04:58,923 --> 00:05:00,174
It's Bea, isn't it?

98
00:05:00,258 --> 00:05:03,261
Tell me the truth that
you're working with Bea!

99
00:05:04,012 --> 00:05:06,556
Don't make this conversation
confusing, okay?

100
00:05:07,223 --> 00:05:09,475
I want ten million pesos.

101
00:05:09,559 --> 00:05:11,769
I'll give you three days.

102
00:05:11,853 --> 00:05:13,730
And if you don't keep
your end of the deal,

103
00:05:13,813 --> 00:05:16,065
I'll post this video.

104
00:05:17,567 --> 00:05:18,901
Hello?

105
00:05:18,985 --> 00:05:20,903
Hello? Hello!

106
00:05:20,987 --> 00:05:22,780
Hello?! Hello?!

107
00:05:22,864 --> 00:05:28,286
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

108
00:05:37,045 --> 00:05:42,675
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

109
00:06:41,984 --> 00:06:43,528
[KEYBOARDS CLACKING]

110
00:06:43,611 --> 00:06:45,196
JD.

111
00:06:45,863 --> 00:06:49,325
Have you listed down
all unused software accounts?

112
00:06:49,408 --> 00:06:51,077
We need it for cost-cutting.

113
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,537
It's already been sent to accounting.

114
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:53,955
Okay.

115
00:07:00,503 --> 00:07:01,671
Jordan.

116
00:07:03,047 --> 00:07:04,799
Why do you keep canceling gigs?

117
00:07:04,882 --> 00:07:06,592
Are you trying to sabotage your career?

118
00:07:06,676 --> 00:07:08,177
Billy needs us right now.

119
00:07:08,886 --> 00:07:10,596
Okay? We should all be here.

120
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,931
- Yeah, but…
- Look, JD?

121
00:07:12,014 --> 00:07:15,393
Can we please double-time
on filtering negative comments about Billy

122
00:07:15,476 --> 00:07:17,728
on the website
and on social media accounts?

123
00:07:17,812 --> 00:07:19,647
They really won't stop.

124
00:07:19,730 --> 00:07:21,315
- I'll leave you to it.
- Okay.

125
00:07:22,692 --> 00:07:23,693
Jordan.

126
00:07:24,735 --> 00:07:27,363
Are you really going to
throw everything away?

127
00:07:28,030 --> 00:07:30,199
Yes, I would.

128
00:07:31,242 --> 00:07:32,618
Okay? Billy needs me.

129
00:07:33,494 --> 00:07:34,454
Okay?

130
00:07:35,371 --> 00:07:37,039
[JORDAN SIGHS DEEPLY]

131
00:07:37,123 --> 00:07:39,208
[KEYBOARDS CLACKING]

132
00:07:39,876 --> 00:07:44,839
[MELLOW MUSIC PLAYING]

133
00:07:51,679 --> 00:07:53,014
[JORDAN] Dude.

134
00:07:54,265 --> 00:07:56,934
We've filtered all comments on the website

135
00:07:57,018 --> 00:07:58,519
and our social media accounts.

136
00:08:00,021 --> 00:08:03,566
For sure, there will be
new comments coming in, but…

137
00:08:03,649 --> 00:08:05,568
every hour, we can filter them.

138
00:08:06,444 --> 00:08:07,904
So, it's okay.

139
00:08:09,447 --> 00:08:11,532
Don't worry, okay?

140
00:08:11,616 --> 00:08:14,327
I canceled all my gigs and meetings

141
00:08:14,410 --> 00:08:16,746
so I can focus on you and LoveList.

142
00:08:16,829 --> 00:08:19,874
Okay? We'll get through this.

143
00:08:19,957 --> 00:08:21,542
Okay? We'll be fine.

144
00:08:24,086 --> 00:08:25,880
We can do this!

145
00:08:25,963 --> 00:08:30,468
[UPLIFTING MUSIC PLAYING]

146
00:08:30,551 --> 00:08:32,470
- [GRUNTS]
<i>- Dude, that's enough!</i>

147
00:08:32,553 --> 00:08:34,138
- [BILLY] <i>Go ahead!</i>
- [JORDAN] <i>Enough!</i>

148
00:08:34,222 --> 00:08:35,848
<i>- Fight back! Let go!</i>
<i>- Stop it, Billy!</i>

149
00:08:35,932 --> 00:08:37,266
<i>Let me go!</i>

150
00:08:37,350 --> 00:08:39,644
<i>- How dare you?!</i>
<i>- Stop it.</i>

151
00:08:41,604 --> 00:08:43,564
<i>He's spreading rumors that</i>
<i>I cheated on the exam,</i>

152
00:08:43,648 --> 00:08:45,816
<i>and that that's why I got</i>
<i>higher grades than him!</i>

153
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:47,235
[PANTING]

154
00:08:47,318 --> 00:08:49,028
<i>- Calm down.</i>
<i>- And now?</i>

155
00:08:49,111 --> 00:08:53,533
<i>All our classmates</i>
<i>think I'm a cheater and a liar!</i>

156
00:08:59,205 --> 00:09:01,374
<i>Don't let them affect you.</i>

157
00:09:01,457 --> 00:09:03,292
<i>I know you're telling the truth.</i>

158
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,211
<i>I've got your back.</i>

159
00:09:08,297 --> 00:09:09,507
[HANDS CLAP]

160
00:09:09,590 --> 00:09:14,011
[UPLIFTING MUSIC CONTINUES]

161
00:09:16,055 --> 00:09:17,682
<i>Want another one?</i>

162
00:09:17,765 --> 00:09:18,849
<i>Sure!</i>

163
00:09:18,933 --> 00:09:20,101
[BOTH CHUCKLE]

164
00:09:20,184 --> 00:09:22,228
<i>- Thanks, dude.</i>
<i>- You're welcome.</i>

165
00:09:22,311 --> 00:09:23,771
<i>Let it go now.</i>

166
00:09:23,854 --> 00:09:24,814
[EXHALES SHARPLY]

167
00:09:31,028 --> 00:09:32,738
Someone's blackmailing me.

168
00:09:32,822 --> 00:09:36,284
[MUSIC BECOMES UNEASY]

169
00:09:36,367 --> 00:09:37,535
Since when?

170
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:41,080
And why didn't you tell me right away?

171
00:09:41,998 --> 00:09:43,332
Because…

172
00:09:43,416 --> 00:09:45,585
Because I didn't want
you getting dragged into this.

173
00:09:45,668 --> 00:09:49,088
- I don't want you to get hurt.
- Okay. Billy, relax, relax.

174
00:09:49,171 --> 00:09:51,090
I don't understand.

175
00:09:51,173 --> 00:09:52,675
Why would I get hurt?

176
00:09:52,758 --> 00:09:59,348
[UNEASY MUSIC CONTINUES]

177
00:10:05,479 --> 00:10:07,898
<i>June 18, 2013.</i>

178
00:10:07,982 --> 00:10:11,652
<i>She killed Jade Valentin in a hit-and-run.</i>

179
00:10:11,736 --> 00:10:13,154
<i>I saw it with my own eyes.</i>

180
00:10:13,237 --> 00:10:14,905
<i>You were the one</i>
<i>who killed her, Billy Cariño!</i>

181
00:10:14,989 --> 00:10:17,325
<i>You are a murderer! You are a criminal!</i>

182
00:10:17,408 --> 00:10:19,118
<i>You have to face justice!</i>

183
00:10:19,201 --> 00:10:24,457
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING, THEN FADES]

184
00:10:25,958 --> 00:10:30,671
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

185
00:10:32,673 --> 00:10:34,425
Who is this bastard?

186
00:10:34,508 --> 00:10:36,719
Why are they using my mom
to ruin your reputation?

187
00:10:37,845 --> 00:10:41,349
How the hell could you have
been there that night?

188
00:10:42,642 --> 00:10:43,684
This is nonsense.

189
00:10:45,811 --> 00:10:47,605
What if it was really me?

190
00:10:50,232 --> 00:10:51,734
Dude, what do you mean?

191
00:10:54,236 --> 00:10:55,446
On the…

192
00:10:58,115 --> 00:11:00,326
- It's okay.
- No.

193
00:11:01,994 --> 00:11:03,829
[BREATHES DEEPLY]

194
00:11:03,913 --> 00:11:06,540
On the night your mother died…

195
00:11:10,044 --> 00:11:12,296
I was at the same place, Jordan.

196
00:11:14,298 --> 00:11:15,633
How could that happen?

197
00:11:15,716 --> 00:11:19,553
That was the night
I rushed my mother to the hospital.

198
00:11:19,637 --> 00:11:21,138
When Oliver was born.

199
00:11:22,139 --> 00:11:23,516
The street…

200
00:11:25,434 --> 00:11:27,311
The street where your mom was found…

201
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:30,439
I drove down that same street.

202
00:11:31,524 --> 00:11:33,526
[BILLY BREATHING SHAKILY]

203
00:11:33,609 --> 00:11:35,403
Are you sure it's the same street?

204
00:11:36,445 --> 00:11:37,405
[BREATH QUIVERING]

205
00:11:37,488 --> 00:11:41,242
Dude, you were too young
to remember back then, okay?

206
00:11:42,827 --> 00:11:45,788
You might be remembering it wrong.

207
00:11:45,871 --> 00:11:48,457
[INHALES SHARPLY, BREATHES SHAKILY]

208
00:11:48,541 --> 00:11:51,919
I drove down that street, Jordan.
I'm sure of it.

209
00:11:52,002 --> 00:11:53,879
Even if you did,

210
00:11:54,672 --> 00:11:57,800
you didn't run over anyone, did you?

211
00:11:57,883 --> 00:12:00,428
Or else you would've stopped, right?

212
00:12:02,471 --> 00:12:04,014
As far as I know, I didn't.

213
00:12:04,932 --> 00:12:06,851
- I hope I didn't!
- You hope so?

214
00:12:06,934 --> 00:12:09,854
I don't remember!

215
00:12:09,937 --> 00:12:11,480
- Sorry!
- No, no.

216
00:12:11,564 --> 00:12:12,565
I'm sorry. [SNIFFLES]

217
00:12:12,648 --> 00:12:14,817
What do you mean you don't remember?

218
00:12:15,401 --> 00:12:17,862
Billy, please. I need to know.

219
00:12:17,945 --> 00:12:21,198
Billy, just focus.

220
00:12:21,282 --> 00:12:22,825
[SOBS]

221
00:12:23,534 --> 00:12:24,827
You have to remember.

222
00:12:26,579 --> 00:12:27,746
I don't…

223
00:12:28,956 --> 00:12:30,082
Billy, I need to know!

224
00:12:30,166 --> 00:12:31,584
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

225
00:12:31,667 --> 00:12:33,294
I don't remember, Jordan!

226
00:12:33,377 --> 00:12:34,628
I'm sorry!

227
00:12:35,421 --> 00:12:36,589
Sorry!

228
00:12:36,672 --> 00:12:37,965
I'm sorry!

229
00:12:40,968 --> 00:12:42,261
This can't be happening.

230
00:12:49,518 --> 00:12:51,520
<i>Hey, want some cake?</i>

231
00:12:56,525 --> 00:12:58,736
<i>While your grandpa is buying some water,</i>

232
00:12:58,819 --> 00:13:00,488
<i>tell me your wish.</i>

233
00:13:00,571 --> 00:13:02,698
<i>I promise I won't tell anyone.</i>

234
00:13:02,781 --> 00:13:04,283
<i>It'll be our secret.</i>

235
00:13:06,243 --> 00:13:07,620
<i>Okay.</i>

236
00:13:12,041 --> 00:13:13,584
<i>My wish…</i>

237
00:13:13,667 --> 00:13:16,795
[SNIFFLING]

238
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:19,798
<i>…is to find who killed my mother.</i>

239
00:13:22,134 --> 00:13:23,344
[SOBS]

240
00:13:24,678 --> 00:13:26,430
[SNIFFLES]

241
00:13:30,684 --> 00:13:34,230
[SOBBING, SNIFFLING]

242
00:13:34,939 --> 00:13:39,693
[MELANCHOLY MUSIC PLAYING]

243
00:13:43,948 --> 00:13:45,783
[YOUNG BILLY] <i>Happy birthday, dude!</i>

244
00:13:46,992 --> 00:13:48,077
<i>- Here.</i>
<i>- Thanks, dude.</i>

245
00:13:49,912 --> 00:13:51,705
<i>It's my birthday again, Mommy.</i>

246
00:13:52,873 --> 00:13:56,669
<i>And every year, I will make the same wish.</i>

247
00:13:56,752 --> 00:14:00,047
<i>That someday, you will finally</i>
<i>get the justice you deserve.</i>

248
00:14:01,924 --> 00:14:08,055
[MELANCHOLY MUSIC CONTINUES]

249
00:14:23,946 --> 00:14:30,953
[MELANCHOLY MUSIC CONTINUES]

250
00:14:45,926 --> 00:14:50,931
[MELANCHOLY MUSIC CONTINUES,
THEN FADES]

251
00:14:55,394 --> 00:15:00,399
[GLUM MUSIC PLAYING]

252
00:15:01,191 --> 00:15:03,319
[SOBBING]

253
00:15:05,487 --> 00:15:07,448
<i>Why are you alone?</i>

254
00:15:07,531 --> 00:15:09,241
<i>Where's your mom?</i>

255
00:15:09,825 --> 00:15:11,577
<i>My mother just died.</i>

256
00:15:12,703 --> 00:15:14,663
<i>My father left us.</i>

257
00:15:14,747 --> 00:15:16,790
<i>We have no relatives.</i>

258
00:15:16,874 --> 00:15:18,792
[SOBS]

259
00:15:18,876 --> 00:15:20,836
<i>It's just my baby brother and me.</i>

260
00:15:22,046 --> 00:15:23,672
[YOUNG JORDAN] <i>We're the same then.</i>

261
00:15:23,756 --> 00:15:25,299
[SNIFFLES]

262
00:15:25,382 --> 00:15:27,176
<i>Mommy just died.</i>

263
00:15:27,676 --> 00:15:29,970
<i>Dad left us with Grandpa.</i>

264
00:15:30,804 --> 00:15:32,431
<i>My name is Jordan.</i>

265
00:15:32,514 --> 00:15:33,807
<i>Billy.</i>

266
00:15:38,437 --> 00:15:41,440
[BILLY SOBBING]

267
00:15:44,318 --> 00:15:46,570
[EMOTIONLESS SINGING]
<i>♪ Oh, light ♪</i>

268
00:15:46,654 --> 00:15:50,115
<i>♪ In the cold night ♪</i>

269
00:15:50,199 --> 00:15:51,033
<i>Cut!</i>

270
00:15:51,116 --> 00:15:52,284
<i>Cut, cut. Okay?</i>

271
00:15:52,368 --> 00:15:53,369
<i>Okay.</i>

272
00:15:54,203 --> 00:15:55,913
<i>This is a serenade!</i>

273
00:15:55,996 --> 00:15:57,957
<i>You're singing like you're at a funeral.</i>

274
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:59,500
<i>How can we win like that?</i>

275
00:15:59,583 --> 00:16:00,501
<i>- Again.</i>
<i>- Okay.</i>

276
00:16:00,584 --> 00:16:01,961
<i>- Do it properly.</i>
<i>- Okay.</i>

277
00:16:02,044 --> 00:16:03,796
[CLEARS THROAT] <i>Go.</i>

278
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:06,173
<i>♪ Oh, light ♪</i>

279
00:16:06,256 --> 00:16:09,385
<i>♪ In the cold night ♪</i>

280
00:16:09,468 --> 00:16:14,181
<i>♪ You're like a star in the sky ♪</i>

281
00:16:15,099 --> 00:16:16,976
<i>Oh, my dear.</i>

282
00:16:17,059 --> 00:16:20,104
<i>I hope I can hear you</i>
<i>finally say yes to me.</i>

283
00:16:20,187 --> 00:16:22,064
<i>Yes, my dear!</i>

284
00:16:22,147 --> 00:16:24,066
<i>I also love you!</i>

285
00:16:27,277 --> 00:16:31,699
[GLUM MUSIC CONTINUES]

286
00:16:34,326 --> 00:16:36,161
<i>- Wake up!</i>
<i>- What?</i>

287
00:16:36,245 --> 00:16:38,414
<i>Look, you're sleeping again!</i>

288
00:16:38,497 --> 00:16:39,623
[GRUNTS]

289
00:16:40,791 --> 00:16:41,917
<i>You jerk!</i>

290
00:16:42,001 --> 00:16:43,711
<i>- Ah! Hey!</i>
- [YOUNG BILLY LAUGHS]

291
00:16:43,794 --> 00:16:45,546
[BOTH LAUGHING]

292
00:16:45,629 --> 00:16:46,714
<i>You jerk!</i>

293
00:16:46,797 --> 00:16:48,799
- [GRUNTS]
- [LAUGHS]

294
00:16:48,882 --> 00:16:51,719
<i>Just go write there,</i>
<i>or you're going to fail.</i>

295
00:16:51,802 --> 00:16:54,388
<i>I'll tell on you to your teacher!</i>

296
00:16:54,471 --> 00:16:56,765
[BOTH CHUCKLING]

297
00:17:09,486 --> 00:17:14,116
[LINE RINGING]

298
00:17:31,383 --> 00:17:34,261
[LINE BEEPS]

299
00:17:34,970 --> 00:17:41,185
[GLUM MUSIC CONTINUES]

300
00:17:47,024 --> 00:17:50,402
[MOTORCYCLE ENGINE RUMBLING]

301
00:17:50,486 --> 00:17:56,492
[RAIN POURING]

302
00:17:57,826 --> 00:18:03,165
[BREATHING SHAKILY]

303
00:18:05,709 --> 00:18:11,590
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

304
00:18:12,966 --> 00:18:14,802
No…

305
00:18:14,885 --> 00:18:16,428
No.

306
00:18:16,512 --> 00:18:19,932
[BREATH QUIVERING]

307
00:18:27,314 --> 00:18:28,941
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

308
00:18:32,277 --> 00:18:34,363
No.

309
00:18:34,446 --> 00:18:37,032
[WHIMPERING, SOBBING]

310
00:19:00,973 --> 00:19:02,474
- [TIRES SCREECH]
- [LOUD THUD]

311
00:19:03,642 --> 00:19:04,810
No.

312
00:19:04,893 --> 00:19:08,188
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

313
00:19:08,272 --> 00:19:13,527
[MUSIC TURNS TENSE]

314
00:19:13,610 --> 00:19:16,905
- [SOBS, MUMBLING INCOHERENTLY]
- [LIGHTNING CRACKS]

315
00:19:19,575 --> 00:19:21,827
[BREATHING SHAKILY]

316
00:19:27,958 --> 00:19:33,255
[BREATH QUIVERING]

317
00:19:34,423 --> 00:19:38,093
No… No!

318
00:19:38,177 --> 00:19:40,095
[SOBS] What did I do?!

319
00:19:40,179 --> 00:19:44,600
[CRYING HYSTERICALLY]

320
00:19:44,683 --> 00:19:47,477
No! No! No!

321
00:19:47,561 --> 00:19:54,443
[CONTINUES CRYING HYSTERICALLY]

322
00:19:55,152 --> 00:20:02,159
[SCREAMING, CRYING]

323
00:20:06,955 --> 00:20:08,457
[JORDAN] Billy!

324
00:20:08,540 --> 00:20:10,250
- Billy!
- [CONTINUES CRYING]

325
00:20:10,334 --> 00:20:12,502
I'm here! It's me, Jordan!

326
00:20:12,586 --> 00:20:14,630
- [PANTING]
- Billy.

327
00:20:14,713 --> 00:20:17,216
- Come on.
- No! No! No!

328
00:20:17,299 --> 00:20:18,550
No, Jordan! No!

329
00:20:18,634 --> 00:20:19,635
- Billy!
- No!

330
00:20:19,718 --> 00:20:21,803
Don't come near me!

331
00:20:21,887 --> 00:20:23,597
- No! [SOBS]
- Billy…

332
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:25,682
- It's okay.
- No! Leave! Leave!

333
00:20:25,766 --> 00:20:27,226
Don't come near me, please!

334
00:20:27,309 --> 00:20:28,310
No, no!

335
00:20:28,393 --> 00:20:29,228
- No, Jordan.
- Billy…

336
00:20:29,311 --> 00:20:30,729
- No…
- It's okay.

337
00:20:30,812 --> 00:20:32,481
No. [CRYING]

338
00:20:32,564 --> 00:20:34,191
Let's go home.

339
00:20:34,274 --> 00:20:35,609
- No!
- Come on.

340
00:20:35,692 --> 00:20:37,611
Leave! Please!

341
00:20:37,694 --> 00:20:39,780
Please go away, Jordan!

342
00:20:39,863 --> 00:20:41,907
Please! [SOBBING]

343
00:20:41,990 --> 00:20:45,494
- Billy, it's okay. Come here.
- [SOBBING]

344
00:20:45,577 --> 00:20:48,330
- It's okay. I'm here.
- You should be mad.

345
00:20:48,413 --> 00:20:49,623
Be mad!

346
00:20:49,706 --> 00:20:51,833
Come on! Blame me!

347
00:20:51,917 --> 00:20:56,129
It's my fault she died, right?!

348
00:20:56,213 --> 00:20:58,257
Be angry!

349
00:20:58,340 --> 00:21:00,759
Why aren't you angry at me?!

350
00:21:00,842 --> 00:21:02,552
- Enough.
- Hate me!

351
00:21:02,636 --> 00:21:04,221
- Stop it!
- Jordan!

352
00:21:04,304 --> 00:21:08,892
[BAWLING]

353
00:21:10,936 --> 00:21:14,898
Sorry. It's all my fault.

354
00:21:15,774 --> 00:21:17,067
I'm sorry!

355
00:21:17,150 --> 00:21:19,361
I'm so sorry, dude! I'm sorry!

356
00:21:19,444 --> 00:21:23,824
Sorry, Jordan!
I didn't mean to! I'm sorry!

357
00:21:24,700 --> 00:21:26,785
Sorry! Sorry!

358
00:21:26,868 --> 00:21:29,162
- [CRYING]
- Billy…

359
00:21:29,246 --> 00:21:31,999
- Listen to me.
- [SOBBING] Jordan.

360
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:34,668
It's okay.

361
00:21:35,836 --> 00:21:36,878
It's okay.

362
00:21:36,962 --> 00:21:40,090
- [KEEPS SOBBING]
- Hey. Hey.

363
00:21:41,091 --> 00:21:42,467
We will find out the truth.

364
00:21:44,261 --> 00:21:46,096
Okay? Whatever it is,

365
00:21:46,179 --> 00:21:48,348
we'll face it together.

366
00:21:48,432 --> 00:21:49,558
You and me.

367
00:21:50,434 --> 00:21:53,020
- Billy, I'm not gonna leave you.
- It's all my fault.

368
00:21:53,103 --> 00:21:56,690
No matter what happens, I'm just here.

369
00:21:56,773 --> 00:21:58,734
Okay?

370
00:21:58,817 --> 00:21:59,693
Jordan.

371
00:21:59,776 --> 00:22:01,403
I won't give up on you.

372
00:22:03,030 --> 00:22:04,156
Okay?

373
00:22:04,906 --> 00:22:06,283
I won't give up on you.

374
00:22:07,951 --> 00:22:09,119
[SOBS]

375
00:22:10,704 --> 00:22:12,748
[CRYING]

376
00:22:15,542 --> 00:22:22,382
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC PLAYING]

377
00:22:43,070 --> 00:22:44,279
<i>Bea!</i>

378
00:22:45,947 --> 00:22:48,075
<i>Wow, you seriously came all the way here?</i>

379
00:22:48,158 --> 00:22:53,580
<i>Jordan, I have nothing to do with</i>
<i>whoever is blackmailing Billy.</i>

380
00:22:53,663 --> 00:22:55,916
<i>Just think about it, okay? I wasn't there.</i>

381
00:22:55,999 --> 00:22:59,252
<i>I don't even know how your mother died.</i>

382
00:22:59,336 --> 00:23:01,588
<i>You're the only one</i>
<i>who has a grudge against Billy.</i>

383
00:23:01,671 --> 00:23:04,049
<i>You're the only one who has the motive.</i>

384
00:23:18,230 --> 00:23:19,648
<i>What did you want to tell me?</i>

385
00:23:20,899 --> 00:23:21,900
<i>This necklace…</i>

386
00:23:24,569 --> 00:23:27,322
<i>My mom was wearing it</i>
<i>the last time I saw her.</i>

387
00:23:27,405 --> 00:23:28,740
<i>The day she died.</i>

388
00:23:31,409 --> 00:23:34,246
<i>But it ended up with Karen,</i>
<i>my dad's partner.</i>

389
00:23:44,005 --> 00:23:45,674
<i>Billy, look.</i>

390
00:23:46,675 --> 00:23:49,636
<i>She's the one in the video.</i>
<i>That's Karen, not Bea.</i>

391
00:23:49,719 --> 00:23:51,346
<i>I remember this dress.</i>
